<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1864543218"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:09.412"><div begin="13.071" end="30.636" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="13.071" end="17.092" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.071" end="14.594">永远都记得</span> <span begin="14.594" end="15.287">最初</span><span begin="15.287" end="15.820">的</span><span begin="15.820" end="16.127">自</span><span begin="16.127" end="17.092">己</span></p><p begin="17.751" end="21.555" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.751" end="19.108">相信去爱</span> <span begin="19.108" end="19.980">只需要</span><span begin="19.980" end="20.635">有</span><span begin="20.635" end="20.891">勇</span><span begin="20.891" end="21.555">气</span></p><p begin="22.451" end="25.030" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.451" end="23.478">骄傲的</span> <span begin="23.478" end="24.267">日夜驻</span><span begin="24.267" end="25.030">守</span></p><p begin="25.687" end="30.636" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.687" end="26.394">用心</span> <span begin="26.394" end="26.748">追</span><span begin="26.748" end="27.657">赶</span> <span begin="27.657" end="27.991">天</span><span begin="27.991" end="30.636">晴</span></p></div><div begin="31.772" end="48.633" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="31.772" end="35.932" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.772" end="32.873">殊不知</span> <span begin="32.873" end="33.783">一路上</span> <span begin="33.783" end="34.052">都</span><span begin="34.052" end="34.666">听</span><span begin="34.666" end="34.967">着</span><span begin="34.967" end="35.932">雨</span></p><p begin="36.616" end="40.599" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.616" end="37.240">单纯</span> <span begin="37.240" end="38.443">却捂冷了</span> <span begin="38.443" end="38.794">紧</span><span begin="38.794" end="39.338">握</span><span begin="39.338" end="39.666">的</span><span begin="39.666" end="40.599">心</span></p><p begin="41.287" end="43.913" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.287" end="42.287">恍惚中</span> <span begin="42.287" end="43.186">窗外响</span><span begin="43.186" end="43.913">起</span></p><p begin="44.421" end="48.633" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.421" end="45.242">催着</span> <span begin="45.242" end="46.333">悲喜</span> <span begin="46.333" end="46.840">同</span><span begin="46.840" end="48.633">鸣</span></p></div><div begin="51.635" end="1:18.457" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="51.635" end="59.543" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.635" end="55.747">爱</span> <span begin="56.140" end="57.604">要多少遗憾</span> <span begin="57.604" end="58.233">来</span><span begin="58.233" end="58.564">澄</span><span begin="58.564" end="59.543">清</span></p><p begin="1:00.887" end="1:08.836" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.887" end="1:04.996">人</span> <span begin="1:05.490" end="1:06.378">陪回忆</span> <span begin="1:06.378" end="1:07.047">纠缠</span><span begin="1:07.047" end="1:07.628">着</span><span begin="1:07.628" end="1:07.956">前</span><span begin="1:07.956" end="1:08.836">行</span></p><p begin="1:09.851" end="1:12.085" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.851" end="1:10.515">眼看</span> <span begin="1:10.515" end="1:11.443">月落乌</span><span begin="1:11.443" end="1:12.085">啼</span></p><p begin="1:12.190" end="1:18.457" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.190" end="1:12.945">长出</span> <span begin="1:12.945" end="1:13.827">无力忘</span><span begin="1:13.827" end="1:14.574">怀</span> <span begin="1:14.574" end="1:14.860">的</span><span begin="1:14.860" end="1:15.410">神</span><span begin="1:15.410" end="1:18.457">情</span></p></div><div begin="1:19.786" end="1:38.064" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:19.786" end="1:23.057" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.786" end="1:20.471">多</span><span begin="1:20.471" end="1:20.871">少</span><span begin="1:20.871" end="1:22.023">的光</span><span begin="1:22.023" end="1:23.057">阴</span></p><p begin="1:23.558" end="1:27.707" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span beg